{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國聯邦航空管理局（FAA）表示，當地時間周日（11月1日）一架載有9人的小型飛機機在佛羅里達州附近的民居墜毁，當局證實機上所有人全部罹難。</p><p>美國交通部長Sean Duffy在社交平台發文指出，飛機於周日下午約12時50分墜毁，形容是一場可怕的悲劇。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T03:41:20.928528+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T02:32:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T06:38:55.784631+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T03:38:07.688650+00:00","content_hash":"10101c618f79846f74919088367695e9029efcd54be3945e1c576bbff7c26fe6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}